302 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 170 0 R
/E (It has been mathematically proven that every nonplanar graph must include K3,3 \(the complete 3-3 bipartite graph\) or K5 \(the complete graph with 5 vertices\) as a subgraph or minor. Thus, a class of general planarity detecting algorithms looks for K3,3 or K5 within graphs. If they are not found, the graph is necessarily planar. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
